  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h3 data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"273\" id=\"isPasted\">🌿 <em data-start=\"248\" data-end=\"271\">Making Heaven Crowded</em></h3><h4 data-start=\"274\" data-end=\"320\">Join the Etch &amp; Lace Ambassador Program</h4><p data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"550\">We believe our work is about more than products — it’s about purpose. Etch &amp; Lace exists to share faith, encouragement, and truth through thoughtfully designed pieces that spark conversation and glorify God in everyday life.</p><p data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"795\">When you join our <em data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"593\">Making Heaven Crowded</em> program, you become part of a community of believers using creativity and connection to spread light. Together, we can inspire others to walk boldly in faith and make heaven a little more crowded. 🤍</p><hr data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"800\"><h3 data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"829\">✨ What You’ll Receive</h3><ul data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"1120\"><li data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"885\"><p data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"885\">A <strong data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"861\">personal affiliate link</strong> to share our products</p></li><li data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"949\"><p data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"949\"><strong data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"906\">10% commission</strong> on every purchase made through your link</p></li><li data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1017\"><p data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"1017\"><strong data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"978\">Exclusive early access</strong> to new releases and limited editions</p></li><li data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1063\"><p data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1063\">Special <strong data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1061\">discounts for personal orders</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1120\"><p data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1120\">Opportunities to be <strong data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1118\">featured on our social media</strong></p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1125\"><h3 data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1157\">🙌 Who We’re Looking For</h3><p data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1191\">Faith-filled women and men who:</p><ul data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1363\"><li data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1230\"><p data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1230\">Love sharing their walk with Jesus</p></li><li data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1270\"><p data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1270\">Create uplifting, authentic content</p></li><li data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1318\"><p data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1318\">Support handmade, small-batch craftsmanship</p></li><li data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1363\"><p data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1363\">Believe in using their platform for good</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1486\">Whether you’re a creator, church leader, or simply someone who wants to spread the Word, we’d love to have you join us.</p><hr data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1491\"><h3 data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1514\">💛 How It Works</h3><p data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1679\">1️⃣ Apply below — it’s quick and simple.<br data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1558\">2️⃣ Get your unique referral link.<br data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1595\">3️⃣ Share your favorite Etch &amp; Lace products and earn commissions with every sale!</p></div></div>",
