  "term_and_condition": "<h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(9, 44, 76); font-weight: 500; text-wrap: wrap; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" id=\"isPasted\">Affiliate Conduct, Fraud &amp; Prohibited Activities</h3><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">To protect our customers, our brand, and our partners, Etch &amp; Lace maintains a zero‑tolerance policy for fraudulent or abusive behavior in our affiliate program.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br>By joining the Etch &amp; Lace affiliate program, you agree to the following:<br><br></p><ol><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; font-weight: bolder; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\">Honest promotion only</strong></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 16px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\">You will represent Etch &amp; Lace and our products truthfully and accurately.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\">You will not make false, misleading, or exaggerated claims about our products, discounts, or policies.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\">You will not use spam tactics (unsolicited bulk messages, comment spam, or deceptive clickbait).<br><br></li></ul></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; font-weight: bolder; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\">No fake or incentivized orders</strong></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 16px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\">You will not place fake orders, use stolen payment methods, or encourage others to do so.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\">You will not offer cash‑back, rebates, or any form of compensation to customers solely to generate tracked orders, unless explicitly approved in writing by Etch &amp; Lace.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\">Orders that are fraudulent, canceled, refunded, or flagged as suspicious may be excluded from commission.<br><br></li></ul></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; font-weight: bolder; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\">Self‑referrals and personal discounts</strong></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 16px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\"><li>Reasonable personal use of your link or code is allowed, but we reserve the right to review and reverse commissions if we detect abuse (e.g., bulk personal orders made only to earn commission).<br><br></li></ul></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; font-weight: bolder; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\">Prohibited traffic sources</strong><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\">Unless you receive written approval from Etch &amp; Lace, you may not:</p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 16px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\">Use coupon or deal sites whose primary purpose is generic discount aggregation.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(9, 44, 76);\">Bid on o